      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمْدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Ash-colour;</i> the <i>colour of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمَاد</span>; as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُبْدَةٌ</span>: (A in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ربد</span>:) <i>a colour like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُرْقَةٌ</span>, <i>inclining to blackness;</i> and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُبْدَةٌ</span>: (T in that art.:)
<i>a colour inclining to that of dust.</i> (M.)

